   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Read me: Minimax-H3-Komikku Simple",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Minimax-H3-Komikku · Simple\n\nOnly this pack and core ComfyUI nodes. Update ComfyUI first: the MiniMax H3 nodes are recent core nodes.\n\n1. **Komikku Page & Shots**: open the editor, design the page and write one shot per panel.\n2. Load your character into **Picture 1** (it is `<Subject 1>` in the prompt).\n3. Run. H3 makes one hard-cut shot per panel, **Komikku Shot Frames** takes the middle frame of each shot and **Komikku Page Compose** builds the page.\n4. Open the Page Compose editor to move and zoom the images inside the panels and add balloons and text, then run again to render the page.\n\nPanels are cropped from the video frames, so a 1:1 video fits both wide and tall panels. For panels extended to their exact shape and a hi-res pass, use the full Minimax-H3-Komikku workflow.\n\n### Models\n\n**MiniMax H3** · [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n- `diffusion_models/minimax/` [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- `text_encoders/minimax/` [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n- `vae/minimax/` [minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- `vae/minimax/` [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n- `loras/minimax/accelerators/` [taomate_h3_3step_comfy.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/chfm/TaoMate-H3-3Step-ComfyUI/resolve/main/taomate_h3_3step_comfy.safetensors), the 3-step LoRA ComfyUI conversion of [TaoLiveAIGC/TaoMate-H3](https://huggingface.co/TaoLiveAIGC/TaoMate-H3)\n\nEach model keeps its own license; check it before commercial use."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Minimax-H3-Komikku · Simple\n\nOnly this pack and core ComfyUI nodes. Update ComfyUI first: the MiniMax H3 nodes are recent core nodes.\n\n1. **Komikku Page & Shots**: open the editor, design the page and write one shot per panel.\n2. Load your character into **Picture 1** (it is `<Subject 1>` in the prompt).\n3. Run. H3 makes one hard-cut shot per panel, **Komikku Shot Frames** takes the middle frame of each shot and **Komikku Page Compose** builds the page.\n4. Open the Page Compose editor to move and zoom the images inside the panels and add balloons and text, then run again to render the page.\n\nPanels are cropped from the video frames, so a 1:1 video fits both wide and tall panels. For panels extended to their exact shape and a hi-res pass, use the full Minimax-H3-Komikku workflow.\n\n### Models\n\n**MiniMax H3** · [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n- `diffusion_models/minimax/` [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- `text_encoders/minimax/` [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n- `vae/minimax/` [minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- `vae/minimax/` [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n- `loras/minimax/accelerators/` [taomate_h3_3step_comfy.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/chfm/TaoMate-H3-3Step-ComfyUI/resolve/main/taomate_h3_3step_comfy.safetensors), the 3-step LoRA ComfyUI conversion of [TaoLiveAIGC/TaoMate-H3](https://huggingface.co/TaoLiveAIGC/TaoMate-H3)\n\nEach model keeps its own license; check it before commercial use."
   },
